WEBVTT

00:16:59.867 --> 00:17:02.215
face the huge challenges

00:17:02.239 --> 00:17:04.294
and also the huge opportunities

00:17:04.318 --> 00:17:07.773
ahead of them at this threshold moment

00:17:07.797 --> 00:17:10.976
in the history of our beautiful planet.

00:17:11.733 --> 00:17:13.281
I thank you for your attention.

00:17:13.305 --> 00:17:18.000
(Applause)